looks like a half of a ball made from bronze. It only covers the upper part of wearers head, leaving the cheeks and neck vulnerable to attacks. A spike is attached to thetop of the helm, making the wearer look more dangerous.**Tekari**Subj: ja vieläkin...!Date: Jun  5These gauntlets made from pure iron are quite impressive looking,but as they are made of rings of metal connected together the have no real value in the means of protection from any bashing damage.They look nice, though.Bracers made from bronze are the typical way of protecting awarrior's arms. A bit like leggings, the are two pieces of platearmour shaped to cover the wearers arms. They seem a bit old, as the bronze used is dented. The plates have some bumps in them, making them a bit uncomfortable to use.Like a coat made from leather, this coat made from chain mail covers your torso. It offers good protection from slashes, but while being more flexible than plate mail, it lets the sheer force of attacks right through. Compared to plate mail it offersless protection but is much lighter. The time consuming way of makingchain mail makes it also more expensive than plate mail.**Maple**Subj: eqCc: **Date: Jun  6i have got my eq back already!!! thanx anyway...**Rimber**Subj: Eq!!!Date: Jun 12Menetin equni viime perjantaina tai millon taa nyt yhtakkia lopetti toimimasta Menin sillon ld:hen kun luulin sen olevan pelkkaa lagia, mut sitten en paassytkaan enaa sisaan ja boottiin oli aika vahan aikaa.Niinpa bootti tuli ja vei mun equt. :(Nyt tahtoisin ne takaisin...**Onarion**Subj: rehti reimbDate: Jul 26jees saa reimbaa jos jaksaa :)**Garath**Subj: lolDate: Aug  502:58 Irmeli <arch>: reimbbi meilii reimbbimeilin peraan mul tuol02:59 Irmeli <arch>: varmaa 80% mun meileist koskee reimbbii :P02:59 Celtron <arch>: jeh02:59 Celtron <arch>: meen pelaa.03:01 Irmeli <arch>: jesKertoo Celtronin inspiksesta aika paljon :PP++Garath**Irmeli**Su